WEBVTT

01:05:27.689 --> 01:05:33.496
CA: So, David, I like to ask everyone
who comes on this podcast,

01:05:33.520 --> 01:05:38.097
if they could implant one idea
in everyone out there,

01:05:38.121 --> 01:05:39.928
what would that idea be?

01:05:39.952 --> 01:05:42.175
DB: What I notice
between first-mountain people

01:05:42.199 --> 01:05:43.458
and second-mountain people

01:05:43.482 --> 01:05:45.444
is those who have fallen into themselves,

01:05:45.468 --> 01:05:48.342
that we all sort of grow life
leading in the ego level, like,

01:05:48.366 --> 01:05:51.337
"I am what the world thinks about me.
I want people to like me.

01:05:51.361 --> 01:05:55.003
I want to be well thought of, I want
to be admired, I want to win victories."

01:05:55.027 --> 01:05:56.656
But in the crucial moment of life,

01:05:56.680 --> 01:05:58.895
you realize those
are not the important things.

01:05:58.919 --> 01:06:00.075
You fall into yourself,